# The Bishop's second class node: two angels for thirty seconds on a two-minute
# cooldown, one giving damage and one dealing it.
#
# The Angel of Benevolence RE-GRANTS instead of staying up: GMS gives a
# four-second buff every five seconds it is out, so the damage is up four
# seconds in five, 20% of the cooldown instead of 25%. See Buff.duty_seconds;
# folding that into the numbers would make the card say 80% where GMS says 100%.
#
# The Avenging Angel's 4.02-second clock isn't published anywhere: GMS's common
# block uses every number for the tooltip, so the client holds this one. It is
# the community DPM calculator's measurement, the same source as the 3.03
# seconds used for Bahamut, Ifrit and Elquines. Seven strikes a cast make
# 77,000%, or 642%/s over the cooldown, well under Spirit of Snow's 1,715%/s, as
# fits a node that also carries a buff this big.
#
# The mark is worth about a twentieth of a percent, and that is right. ONE LINE
# uses it up (GMS's footnotes count this in hits), so seven marks a cast boost
# seven lines out of the fourteen hundred a Bishop lands in the same two
# minutes. The angel can't use its own marks: GMS gives it no element, and only
# holy hits use them.
#
# The party's share keeps GMS's INT steps exactly, as Benediction's does: 43,750
# INT reaches the 40% cap, and a Bishop here tops out near 8,700, so the party
# gets eleven points of it. Rescaling would make it a different skill.
#
# Dropped: the MP, attack reflection (nothing here has it), and "targets the
# boss with the highest HP first", since a boss swing already hits the
# healthiest part. GMS's "not usable while Bahamut is active" is also left out
# of the description as older wording: the client dismisses the dragon instead,
# which is what silences_skill_name does and what the card's Dismisses row
# shows.
name: "Angel of Balance"
description:
  "Summons an angel of compassion and vengeance. The Angel of Benevolence "
  "heals your party and increases your damage and theirs; the Avenging Angel "
  "strikes the enemy and marks what it hits."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP_V skill_order: 2 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
mark {
  duration_seconds: 60.0
  final_dmg_pct: 0.10
  lifted_tag: SKILL_TAG_HOLY
}
buff {
  duration_seconds: 30.0
  duty_seconds: 4.0
  duty_interval_seconds: 5.0
  silences_skill_name: "Bahamut"
  base { damage_pct: 1.00 }
  ally_base {
    damage_pct: 0.05
    regen_pct: 0.102
    regen_interval_seconds: 5.0
  }
  ally_per_level { regen_pct: 0.002 }
  ally_int_lever {
    int_step: 1250
    effect { damage_pct: 0.01 }
    cap { damage_pct: 0.40 }
  }
  pulse {
    label: "Avenging Angel"
    cast_interval_seconds: 4.02
    lines: 10
    max_enemies: 12
    base { skill_pct: 5.20 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.20 }
  }
}
